scenario early over g5_scen_decisions
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-02

move top: transfers
  on from_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount min(top_amt, bal(konto))

move lift: transfers
  on late_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount min(lift_amt, bal(konto))

ask q_e: bal(konto, 2026-01-05) in early
ask q_e2: bal(konto, 2026-01-02) in early
ask q_ef: flows(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-05) in early
